type: software
title: "Fenius: Manuscript Structure and Bookbinding Workflows"
abstract: >-
  Fenius is a Vue-based application for manuscript workflows, including
  ruling-scheme creation, manuscript metadata processing, and interactive
  book-spine visualization.
